{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1496318-fetishes-talens-made-of-werebeasts-or-even-their-own-breed-\u2019-remains","id":1496318,"title":"Fetishes/Talens made of werebeasts(or even their own breed)\u2019 remains","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-06T10:39:30-08:00","id":1496318,"title":"Fetishes/Talens made of werebeasts(or even their own breed)\u2019 remains","content":"I swear I saw several of them but can\u2019t recall now. Human tribes always have customs of making kines\u2019 remain into relic/spoiler, so I think that\u2019s okay for garou and fera<br /> <br /> My players used to customize a level 4 Fenris fetish called Loser\u2019s Drum, forged from a skull of BSD elder who was killed by them lol, when you hit that, it will have a sound making all wyrmish creatures nearby suffer penalties\u2026","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-06T13:22:14-08:00","id":1496330,"title":"","content":"There are a few scattered around the books, so it's not a huge part of Garou culture, but they certainly accept it when it fits their concepts of what an appropriate vessel for a spirit is.<br /> <br /> I would say there's a slight tendency to prefer Wyrm tainted remains to be turned into Talens rather than Fetishes, but even Hammer &amp; Klaive doesn't really go into any detail about that. It just seems like a logical extrapolation of Garou (and most Gaian shifters) anti-Wyrm taboos where even fully cleansed remains are still seen as &quot;icky.&quot;<br /> <br /> The drum idea is a great one.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-06T17:05:04-08:00","id":1496342,"title":"","content":"Ragers are an example of a fetish made from a bone of a Garou (an Ahroun to be specific). I think they are found in the Players Guides.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-07T03:44:17-08:00","id":1496387,"title":"","content":"Remembering Remnant (Skinner- SAS) was also made from a fallen changer.<br /> <br /> Fire Tooth (Red Talon revised) is made from the Talon's own tooth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/562-lachdanan","name":"Lachdanan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-08T06:14:52-08:00","id":1496486,"title":"","content":"Early shadow lords were quite morbid and would probably use this kind of thing. Uktena are different in some respects but I think they'd do it too. <br /> GoF certainly killed an above average number of Fera and have accumulated more grudges than most, perhaps this practice would be one of their many incentives. <br /> <br /> BF wouldn't bat an eye if they claimed the part belonged to some chauvinist. <br /> Fianna would be kinda interesting because they really like a big tale for every fetish and it'd be interesting to see how they'd change their tune as their relationship to the fera waxes and wanes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-30T12:28:48-07:00","id":1506973,"title":"","content":"I feel like I'd be going for almost a total opposite feeling. Like saints bones or remains of an honorable or otherwise remarkable adversary.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> This is the skull of my great uncle, he was a magnificent warrior who died honorably and by my hand when his illness began to be a burden to his people, honored spirit, pleace grace this skull with your presence and fill it once again with strategy and war, let it ring again with howls that unite allies and scatter foes. </div> </div> </div>followed by some kind of WP vs Gnosis roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27296-devidramoth","name":"Devidramoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27296_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}